It is getting late now.
I get ready to go home.
I thank Priya for the wonderful food.
"The food was very tasty," I say.
Priya smiles and says that she is glad.
I tell her that next time we will meet at my flat.
"Next time you must come to my house," I say.
"I will cook special Mexican food for you."
Priya gets very happy hearing this.
She says that she will definitely come.
"I like Mexican food very much," Priya tells me.
"Come on, let's plan this soon," I say.
"Yes, we will talk in the office on Monday," she says.
I pick up my bag.
We say goodbye to each other.
I walk towards the metro station.
A cool breeze is blowing outside.
I think that tonight was very good.
I am happy that I have made a new friend in Mumbai.
